Subject: [PATCH 1139/1179] The sheet's duduk and shofar rows carry their LoRA
 A/B by epoch (1166, part nineteen)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «гайд по инструментам полностью пересмотри и сверь с тем, что я одобрил +
наши два набора LoRA — Дудук и Шофар». The sheet read row by row against his approvals (200: 159
heard, 6 kept with his words, 35 not identified, none waiting), and the rows of the instruments our
own adapters play now carry the adapter's A/B by epoch from the approved LoRA probes
(ab-INSTRUMENT-base|eNNN-a|b in a 💎 workspace): the engine alone first, then each epoch, ▶ A and
▶ B with their seeds and his marks. Its two words in the seven languages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
